        "Going into sajdah knees first, then hands, then nose and forehead; and rising in the reverse order." to "Kuingia kwenye magoti ya sajdah kwanza, kisha mikono, kisha pua na paji la uso; na kupanda kwa mpangilio wa nyuma.",
