        "After any of these the prayer is started again" to "Baada ya hayo maombi huanza tena",
        "Speaking, even one word — on purpose, by mistake or out of forgetfulness." to "Kuzungumza, hata neno moja - kwa makusudi, kwa makosa au kwa kusahau.",
