        "‘Amal-e-kathir: so much movement that an onlooker would think you are not praying." to "‘Amal-e-kathir: mwendo mwingi kiasi kwamba mtazamaji atafikiri kuwa huombi.",
        "Turning the chest away from the Qibla without a valid excuse." to "Kugeuza kifua kutoka kwa Qibla bila ya udhuru halali.",
