        "Crying or groaning aloud from pain or worldly grief. Weeping from the fear of Allah does not break it." to "Kulia au kuugua kwa sauti kutokana na maumivu au huzuni ya kidunia. Kulia kwa kumcha Mwenyezi Mungu hakuvunji.",
        "The wudu breaking, or a quarter of a limb of the awrah staying uncovered for the time of three tasbih." to "Kupasuka kwa wudhu, au robo ya kiungo cha awrah kukaa wazi kwa muda wa tasbihi tatu.",
        "Leaving out a Fard, or a mistake in recitation that corrupts the meaning." to "Kuacha Fard, au kosa katika kisomo ambalo linaharibu maana.",
