        "Rushing: not standing upright after ruku‘, or not sitting upright between the two sajdahs." to "Kukimbia: Kutosimama wima baada ya rukuu, au kutokukaa sawa kati ya sajdah mbili.",
        "A prayer offered with a Makruh-e-Tahrimi act is valid but must be repeated; a Makruh-e-Tanzihi act only lessens the reward." to "Swala inayoswaliwa kwa kitendo cha Makruh-e-Tahrimi ni sahihi lakini lazima irudiwe; kitendo cha Makruh-e-Tanzihi kinapunguza tu malipo.",
        "Times when Salah is not prayed" to "Nyakati ambazo Swalah haiswaliwi",
