        "Sunrise: from the first edge of the sun until it has risen well, about twenty minutes." to "Kuchomoza kwa jua: kutoka kwenye makali ya kwanza ya jua hadi imeongezeka vizuri, kama dakika ishirini.",
        "Midday: from Dahwa-e-Kubra until the sun passes its highest point (Zawal)." to "Mchana: kutoka Dahwa-e-Kubra mpaka jua lipite sehemu yake ya juu kabisa (Zawal).",
        "Sunset: from when the sun turns pale until it has set, about twenty minutes — except that day's Asr, which must still be prayed." to "Machweo ya jua: kuanzia pale jua linapobadilika rangi hadi linapotua, takriban dakika ishirini - isipokuwa Asr ya siku hiyo, ambayo bado lazima iswaliwe.",
        "In these three times no prayer is allowed: not Fard, Wajib, Nafl or Qaza, nor Sajdah Tilawat." to "Katika nyakati hizi tatu hakuna swala inayoruhusiwa: si Fard, Wajib, Nafl au Qaza, wala Sajdah Tilawat.",
