        "After the Fard of Fajr until sunrise, and after the Fard of Asr until sunset, Nafl is not prayed; Qaza and Sajdah Tilawat are allowed." to "Baada ya Alfajiri mpaka kuchomoza kwa jua, na baada ya Fard ya Alasiri mpaka kuzama kwa jua, Nafl haiswaliwi; Qaza na Sajdah Tilawat zinaruhusiwa.",
        "Prayers that have a cause, such as Qaza, Tahiyyat-ul-Masjid and Janazah, may be prayed in these times." to "Sala zenye sababu, kama vile Qaza, Tahiyyat-ul-Masjid na Janazah, zinaweza kuswaliwa katika nyakati hizi.",
        "Purification before Salah" to "Utakaso kabla ya Swalah",
