        "Wipe the whole head once with wet hands, then the ears. The extent that is required varies by school." to "Futa kichwa nzima mara moja kwa mikono ya mvua, kisha masikio. Kiwango kinachohitajika kinatofautiana na shule.",
        "Wash both feet including the ankles, right then left, three times." to "Osha miguu yote miwili pamoja na vifundo vya miguu, kulia kisha kushoto, mara tatu.",
        "Four acts are Fard: washing the face, washing both arms with the elbows, wiping a quarter of the head, and washing both feet with the ankles. The rest is Sunnah." to "Matendo manne ni Fard: kuosha uso, kuosha mikono yote miwili kwa viwiko, kupangusa robo ya kichwa, na kuosha miguu yote kwa vifundo vya miguu. Mengine ni Sunnah.",
        "Wiping part of the head suffices; the intention and the order of the limbs are also Fard." to "Kuifuta sehemu ya kichwa inatosha; nia na mpangilio wa viungo pia ni Fard.",
