        "Wiping the entire head with the ears is Fard, as are rinsing the mouth and nose, the order and washing without a break." to "Kuifuta kichwa kizima kwa masikio ni Fard, kama vile suuza kinywa na pua, utaratibu na kuosha bila mapumziko.",
        "What breaks wudu" to "Nini kinavunja wudhu",
