        "Flowing blood and vomit do not break wudu; touching the private parts with the palm, or the skin of a non-mahram of the opposite sex, does." to "Damu inayotiririka na matapishi hayavunji wudhu; kugusa sehemu za siri kwa kiganja, au ngozi ya asiye Mahram wa jinsia tofauti, hufanya hivyo.",
        "The bath that removes major impurity" to "Umwagaji unaoondoa uchafu mkubwa",
